Today is Tuesday.
I see Anitha at the apartment.
"It has now been a month since Maya came to Kochi," Anitha says.
"We can go drink coffee tomorrow evening."
I ask, "At what time are we going?"
"We can go at half past five in the evening," she says.
I look at the calendar on my phone.
I have an appointment at the salon tomorrow at half past five.
I need to get a haircut.
I tell Anitha, "I need to go to the salon tomorrow at half past five."
"But, I will change that time."
"We can go to the cafe tomorrow at half past five itself."
Anitha smiles.
We decide to meet on Wednesday evening.
